<h2>Purpose</h2>
<p>This website helps patients understand cosmetic and reconstructive procedures before they meet {{ site.fullName }}. It is written in plain language and is not a substitute for a personal consultation.</p>

<h2>Who is responsible</h2>
<p>All content is published under the responsibility of {{ site.fullName }}, {{ site.shortCredentials }}, a plastic, cosmetic and reconstructive surgeon practising in Lahore. You can read about his training on the <a href="/about/">About page</a>.</p>

<h2>Medical review</h2>
<p>Procedure pages and articles are checked by Dr. Junaid for medical accuracy. Once a page has been formally reviewed, the review date is shown near the top of that page. Every page also shows the date it was last updated.</p>

<h2>Our standards</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Information reflects mainstream, current medical practice and is kept conservative.</li>
  <li>Risks and limitations are described alongside benefits.</li>
  <li>Recovery times are given as typical ranges; individual results vary.</li>
  <li>We do not publish invented statistics or promises of results.</li>
  <li>Before and after photos are shown only with patient consent.</li>
  <li>Fees are confirmed individually after consultation.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Corrections</h2>
<p>If you think something on this website is inaccurate or out of date, please email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>. We review every report and update the page where needed.</p>
